  "description": "Unmask the allure of digital paper, skillfully adorned with a chic, distressed comic clouds touch. Boasting a high-quality resolution of 2480×3508 px, they’re an ideal complement for A4 creations that sing a symphony of whimsical cartoon beauty. Included is a collection of six A4 Distressed Comic Clouds Papers – offered in both JPG and PNG formats, and in crystal clear resolution of 300 dpi and vibrant RGB. \nWhether it’s for crafting delightful cards, framing mesmerizing artwork, embellishing kids’ crafts, ornamenting scrapbooks, personalizing t-shirts, sprucing up pillows and bags, adorning mugs, or adding creativity to stickers, the possibilities are as vast as your imagination. \nAs such, it’s worth noting that you will require a computer to unzip the files and a design program (that supports JPG/PNG file formats) to fully exploit the potential of these arresting graphics. Additionally, these are digital downloads and will be immediately accessible after purchase, without the need for shipping. All images are primed, colored, and ready for use. Given variances in screen calibrations, note that the actual print colors may slightly differ from the colors you see on your screen. \nProfoundly grateful for your engagement, we hope you find immense joy in our creations! The files you download will be free of any watermarks, but are elegantly protected by copyright law – the Digital Image Files may not be copied, distributed, modified, shared, or resold. Explore the fun and sophistication of these distressed comic clouds papers, now!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Unmask the allure of digital paper, skillfully adorned with a chic, distressed comic clouds touch. Boasting a high-quality resolution of 2480×3508 px, they’re an ideal complement for A4 creations that sing a symphony of whimsical cartoon beauty. Included is a collection of six A4 Distressed Comic Clouds Papers – offered in both JPG and PNG formats, and in crystal clear resolution of 300 dpi and vibrant RGB. </p>\n<p>Whether it’s for crafting delightful cards, framing mesmerizing artwork, embellishing kids’ crafts, ornamenting scrapbooks, personalizing t-shirts, sprucing up pillows and bags, adorning mugs, or adding creativity to stickers, the possibilities are as vast as your imagination. </p>\n<p>As such, it’s worth noting that you will require a computer to unzip the files and a design program (that supports JPG/PNG file formats) to fully exploit the potential of these arresting graphics. Additionally, these are digital downloads and will be immediately accessible after purchase, without the need for shipping. All images are primed, colored, and ready for use. Given variances in screen calibrations, note that the actual print colors may slightly differ from the colors you see on your screen. </p>\n<p>Profoundly grateful for your engagement, we hope you find immense joy in our creations! The files you download will be free of any watermarks, but are elegantly protected by copyright law – the Digital Image Files may not be copied, distributed, modified, shared, or resold. Explore the fun and sophistication of these distressed comic clouds papers, now!</p>",
